<title>USA: UAL sets daily Chicago-Sao Paulo flights.</title>
<headline>UAL sets daily Chicago-Sao Paulo flights.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Airlines, a unit of UAL Corp, said Tuesday it will operate daily nonstop flights between Chicago and Sao Paulo, Brazil, beginning October 26, 1997.</p>
<p>Tickets go on sale immediately.</p>
<p>The carrier said it becomes the only airline with nonstop service between the Midwestern United States and South America.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
